 10
Write a query to display all the employees working with JAMES.
(Nested Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT EMPNO, ENAME, DEPTNO
     FROM EMP
     WHERE DEPTNO =
     (
         SELECT DEPTNO
         FROM EMP
         WHERE ENAME='JAMES'
     );

Output:
-------

EMPNO   ENAME    DEPTNO
------  -------  ------
7499    ALLEN      30
7521    WARD       30
7654    MARTIN     30
7698    BLAKE      30
7844    TURNER     30
7900    JAMES      30
